only probes /health, ADR-0026 auto-rollback never fired during a functional outage — the bad build stayed live. The root-cause fix (change 264) is landed, but this defense-in-depth gap remains: a functional failure is invisible to the deploy/rollback layer.\n\n## What\n- Add a functional readiness endpoint (e.g. /ready) to the review-bot app that exercises the review path wiring (ticket-store clone materialization + runner config re-root) — NOT just process liveness.\n- Point autodeploy.sh's post-deploy health gate at /ready so a review-path regression triggers ADR-0026 auto-rollback to :prev.\n- Keep the VOTER_ERROR CloudWatch alarm as the slower backstop.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] /ready (or equivalent) exercises the review path and fails when ticket-store/runner wiring is broken\n- [ ] autodeploy.sh gates the deploy on /ready; a broken build auto-rolls-back to :prev\n- [ ] Test/proof that a simulated review-path failure trips the gate","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"79fb99d9-c91d-459b-bc58-f9364bbc1122","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":[],"ticket_id":"cc84-0054-0bf1-4a67","ticket_type":"epic","title":"Review-bot functional readiness probe so ADR-0026 auto-rollback catches review-path (not just /health) failures","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f8e8e2da-bf08-4b38-ad9f-f8075feadbca","e6978025-208a-4825-9a6d-9bd4a3f8b99a","f65b6994-59d9-40f6-9fb2-4301c0734d3a","4a45ab1a-4b81-43a0-a2db-03b77d6ee43f","79fb99d9-c91d-459b-bc58-f9364bbc1122"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659665787316001,"uuid":"1d2c599a-bc0a-4e28-9429-e07531ae52a7"}